{"drafts": [{"draft_id": "c6d0c02c-7d88-5076-afbc-e248cb0efcb7", "doc_id": "1291f40b-7db3-5798-9061-f3310b3f99fe", "name": "规则冲突优先级裁决", "description": "当两条或多条交通仿真规则对同一对象给出不同约束时，按作用域具体性裁决：更具体的规则（如针对单条边的场景规则）覆盖更通用的规则（如通用容量规则）。用于规则解释、状态推进或控制器决策前的冲突消解。", "asset_type": "safety_rule", "granularity": "micro", "asset_node_id": "safety_rule_node", "asset_path": "family_root/safety_module/safety_rule_node", "asset_level": 2, "visible_role": "leaf", "objective": "在规则冲突时确定唯一生效规则，避免未定义行为", "domain": "交通仿真规则", "task_family": "规则冲突消解", "method_family": "作用域具体性优先", "stage": "规则应用前", "applicable_signals": ["两条规则对同一对象给出不同约束", "场景特定规则与通用规则同时适用"], "contraindications": ["规则之间无冲突", "冲突涉及未定义行为且无更具体规则可依"], "intervention_moves": ["识别冲突规则及其作用对象", "比较规则作用域的具体性", "指定作用域更具体的规则为生效规则", "记录覆盖理由"], "workflow_steps": ["确认存在规则冲突：两条或多条规则对同一对象给出不同约束。", "比较冲突规则的作用域具体性（如针对单条边的场景规则 vs 通用容量规则）。", "指定作用域更具体的规则为生效规则。", "输出生效规则及覆盖理由；若无更具体规则可依，标记为未定义行为。"], "triggers": ["两条规则对同一对象给出不同约束", "场景特定规则与通用规则同时适用"], "constraints": ["仅在规则确实冲突时执行裁决", "裁决依据为作用域具体性，不得引入其他偏好", "无更具体规则可依时不得臆造裁决"], "cautions": ["避免将无冲突情形误判为冲突", "未定义行为需明确标记而非强行消解"], "output_contract": ["明确指定生效规则及其覆盖理由；若无更具体规则可依，则标记为未定义行为。"], "examples": [{"input": "场景规则规定某条边容量为 X，通用容量规则给出不同值。", "output": "生效规则：该边的场景规则（作用域更具体），覆盖通用容量规则。", "notes": "针对单条边的场景规则优先于通用规则。"}], "risk_class": "medium", "confidence": 0.85, "support_ids": ["ff334183-65e6-53c1-aabf-59543ca13ee3"], "metadata": {"prompt": "在应用规则前检查是否存在冲突：若两条或多条规则对同一对象给出不同约束，比较各规则的作用域具体性，选择作用域更具体的规则作为生效规则，并说明其覆盖更通用规则的理由。若冲突中不存在更具体的规则可依，则视为未定义行为，不要臆造裁决。", "tags": ["规则冲突消解", "作用域具体性", "交通仿真", "护栏规则"], "files": {}, "resources": {}, "source_sections": ["User Questions"], "extraction_unit": "window", "domain_type": "traffic simulation rules", "taxonomy_id": "traffic simulation rules", "asset_node_id": "safety_rule_node", "asset_path": "family_root/safety_module/safety_rule_node", "asset_level": 2, "visible_role": "leaf", "candidate_slot": 1, "window_id": "a5ba6099-4676-52a3-bf76-1da9a8b60205", "window_strategy": "strict", "anchor_hits": [], "paragraph_start": 13, "paragraph_end": 15, "heading_path": ["User Questions"], "parent_heading": "", "sibling_headings": ["CL-Bench: Empirical Discovery & Simulation / Simulation Environment", "System Context"], "subsection_headings": ["1. Overview", "2. Nodes and Edges", "3. Time and Update Order", "4. Vehicles", "5. Consignments (Packages)", "6. Legal Actions Per Tick", "7. Edge Capacity, Queues, and Conflicts", "8. Traffic Signals", "9. Loading and Unloading", "10. Incidents and Road Closures", "11. Priorities and Service Levels", "12. Controller Objectives", "13. Rule Conflicts and Undefined Behavior", "1. Map Overview", "2. Edges", "3. Signal Settings", "4. Vehicles in the Morning Rush Scenario", "5. Consignments", "6. Incidents", "7. Scenario Horizon and Objective", "1. State Snapshot Format", "1.1 GLOBAL Section", "1.2 NODES Section", "1.3 EDGES Section", "1.4 VEHICLES Section", "1.5 CONSIGNMENTS Section", "1.6 INCIDENTS_ACTIVE Section", "2. Worked Example A:Simple Departure", "3. Worked Example B:Signal at Central Intersection", "4. Worked Example C:Capacity Reduction Incident"], "context_snippets": [], "heading_number": "", "heading_kind": "outline_llm", "section_summary": "R1. The Arclight Freight Network (AFN) is a fictional urban road and logistics system used to simulate movement of vehicles and packages over discrete time steps."}}], "supports": [{"support_id": "ff334183-65e6-53c1-aabf-59543ca13ee3", "doc_id": "1291f40b-7db3-5798-9061-f3310b3f99fe", "section": "User Questions", "excerpt": "R49. Secondary objectives may include minimizing total distance traveled or minimizing the number of vehicles used, but these only apply when explicitly specified.

13. Rule Conflicts and Undefined Behavior

R50. If two rules appear to conflict, rules with more specific scope override more general rules. For example, a scenario-specific rule about a single edge overrides this document’s generic capacity rule for that edge.", "relation_type": "constraint", "confidence": 0.85}], "target_state": "active"}
